PS2Engine By David Froy 
Version: V 0.14
Date: April 12, 2004

Features
--------
Dma Memory Manager
Dma Scheduler
Matrix Manager using OpenGl like commands
Custom Models using Path 3(ie channel 2)
Custom Models using openGl like commands
Simple MD2 and MS3D loaders (to be replaced by proper, perspective correct version)
VU Micro Code Manager


Commands
--------

Class Name: Matrix_Manager
--------------------------
WARNING!!!! The ps2 uses transposed matrix, ie matrix[2][3] is actually matrix[3][2] on the ps2, keep in mind


Constructors:
 Matrix_Manager() - simply does a loadIdentity to all the matrixs

Deconstors:
 ~Matrix_Manager() - empty matrix deconstrutor

Functions:
int matrixMode(int tmpCurrentMode) - sets the current mode and returns the old mode, options are as follows
	VIEW - view matrix
	PROJECTION - projection matrix
	CAMERA - camera matrix
	LIGHT - light matrix
	MODELVIEW - model matrix
	COLOR - color matrix






